## LLM integration

Claude Code should treat the LLM as the **synthesis layer**, not the database or ontology layer. The database stack prepares structured evidence; the LLM interprets it. The longer ORCA brief explicitly recommends a structured reasoning prompt pattern that compares analogues, identifies differences, evaluates causal chains, assigns a probability view, and states failure conditions or blind spots. That means the application should pass the model grouped evidence blocks rather than raw search results. [ppl-ai-file-upload.s3.amazonaws](https://ppl-ai-file-upload.s3.amazonaws.com/web/direct-files/attachments/171602833/bdcdfbc1-3ffb-4a1f-82ed-37272e04168b/compass_artifact_wf-b573296b-2106-4bcf-b2be-d7a91d3b3b52_text_markdown.md)

The LLM integration should remain provider-agnostic through a lightweight abstraction layer, and the system should be built so that retrieval and context formatting are deterministic even if the model changes. In practical terms, Claude Code should keep prompt templates versioned, retrieval output typed, and synthesis interfaces stable. This ensures the reasoning quality can improve over time without redesigning storage and retrieval. [ppl-ai-file-upload.s3.amazonaws](https://ppl-ai-file-upload.s3.amazonaws.com/web/direct-files/attachments/171602833/bdcdfbc1-3ffb-4a1f-82ed-37272e04168b/compass_artifact_wf-b573296b-2106-4bcf-b2be-d7a91d3b3b52_text_markdown.md)

## Implementation guardrails

Several guardrails should be treated as best practices, not optional niceties. First, **no permanent knowledge belongs in TTL caches**. The PRD explicitly deprecates TTL-based cache entries for persistent data, which means graph facts, analogue links, and market history must be stored durably in the three-engine architecture rather than hidden in transient memory layers. Second, ingestion adapters should be written as boundary-layer components so each source can be validated, normalized, and replayed independently. Third, seed analogues and causal chains should be curated enough to support early trust; the architecture assumes high-quality analogue cases are a feature, not an implementation detail. [ppl-ai-file-upload.s3.amazonaws](https://ppl-ai-file-upload.s3.amazonaws.com/web/direct-files/attachments/171602833/4660d6a2-cfa6-45db-8633-4cafede7ffd3/ORCA_PHASE-PRD.md?AWSAccessKeyId=ASIA2F3EMEYERLBN3DPL&Signature=caYsnPvLzcKiPMgmGxZcF8cCVl0%3D&x-amz-security-token=IQoJb3JpZ2luX2VjEAcaCXVzLWVhc3QtMSJIMEYCIQC3a8XJS2qHo39hLVdUp1trkc5xdrXjhBbc7V2JUMcMqQIhALL0%2BlJ3QqQQWa0J3bohy%2FmookAjC89JF8NhAr%2Fb7c35KvwECND%2F%2F%2F%2F%2F%2F%2F%2F%2F%2FwEQARoMNjk5NzUzMzA5NzA1IgxxDalLkBBmmWqIL8gq0AQqcHAimuHL%2B4C2LmjZUDrXp2OVITAhifJbM4cJivoDbmCbJo1zkHwTWmIST2i5xwLU7UKqixAW%2BJd0AmIoOgdKwChHnB5Y3x68wVUbQkRyZiSGbvxWUu828%2BqFXVWZcUWsslQIs%2BkoIvj9BTFgnghAeNVeXYeh1n1YG6ZI7I9RR76VXOFSIsIF61Wq9CaJ94iuCm34w1qekppUYdIXpq0qkTwRv4FzoDKHFoTdJTAwiKGzoeLsTriv0iQhAojRJzHE%2Ff998f3G%2BEYO9KSq27yf6EYVyULOlK5QCnp7IV46310aUK8RHSvkVS8WF2OrYmfagL5eknHtgJ78C8nWO7%2F2IuvUkCeVZaBlyHDyH4BwjGS8cuAOxKH9o6REDy6hA4IghCPdNIg2gb%2F0V5ERYHnCmgjEWBHeE9YRPTZjuWwbzlgnDfgt1FnMGiRD%2BNI4vSpU0Jkiu8TKDLUSJaMsGYXxPG9bdylHEKCyHq978yq06arMf%2B3lD94yxBPHUX%2BTUlSQKDVbwOm2JShrbHqR8KbOSuMHOZp3mo%2Fc5XrI5V7n9kiDPhhSzpE7wsWglLIDtAJ2mgRDlMCVwY6vIJNg3HNCttvoME0GtVBBKkw%2BN8hBq9cVSRZuVq3svx90YUEPR%2BQZzI0hLHF4h9fDzl1hVR5A6%2FnjsGh04CwodWdDM%2F12T1Aotj1yzvD4MzxCTYx9xau%2FVNDIXIHsCGQYh0wje%2FQHeqr7VbyWVhRyJonVmlQllqAPHz%2BFkAAKCqAUxx